OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled and road warnings
OL,4,Aas Scotland prepares for Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FForecasters say the storm, which is the
OL,7,Fsecond named storm in two days, could
OL,8,Fresult in injury, flying debris, power
OL,9,Fcuts and damage to trees and buildings.
